## Staged Rollout Strategy in Unleash

Enterprise features roll out through four strictly monitored rings using **Gradual Rollout Strategy** with **User ID Stickiness** to guarantee consistent user experience:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Ring0["Ring 0: Dogfood\n(100% Internal Staff)\n• isInternalUser == true\n• QA & E2E Validation"] --> Ring1
    Ring1["Ring 1: Canary\n(5% User Rollout)\n• Stickiness: userId\n• Datadog Crash Watch"] --> Ring2
    Ring2["Ring 2: Ramp\n(25% User Rollout)\n• Performance Audits\n• API Latency Check"] --> Ring3
    Ring3["Ring 3: Broad\n(50% Geographic)\n• Regional Verification\n• Conversion Metrics"] --> Ring4
    Ring4["Ring 4: Full GA\n(100% All Users)\n• Flag Retirement Plan\n• 30-Day TTL Activated"]

